      "content": "That's a good start for the vibe, but I need more granular detail for the mood board. I need to give the photographers and casting directors a clearer idea of the actual people we're talking about. \n\nCould you describe the physical archetypes for both? Like, when we imagine these two groups walking through a high-end district, what are the specific visual cues in their features, skin tones, and overall 'look' that distinguish them? I want to make sure the casting reflects the distinct social realities of these two different worlds.",
